    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463910/extras/c3994ee687c18e66131feacdf726c893.poster.avif?t=1755148438\" width=700 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463910/extras/c3994ee687c18e66131feacdf726c893.webm?t=1755148438\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463910/extras/c3994ee687c18e66131feacdf726c893.mp4?t=1755148438\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25b6\u00a0<i>&quot;But I'm still not the strongest...!&quot;</i></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>\u00a0</strong></i>Snow \u2022 Fall is a  deck builder rogue-like that mixes unique and strategic gameplay with fast-paced fights and satisfying item synergies.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play a Cube and have Droplets face off. The person who rolls the higher number gets to attack.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch as your character performs high-damage combos against the enemy at your command. Or have the opposite happen, if you're bad.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each battle is a test of your game knowledge and\u00a0ability to\u00a0adapt to unknown circumstances.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more you play, the more you'll understand. Make game destroying combinations or be sent back to the main menu, it all depends on you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2800 <br>\u2800</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2800</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463910/extras/c913f5d0abfd9b56ebc4d6106207136b.poster.avif?t=1755148438\" width=800 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463910/extras/c913f5d0abfd9b56ebc4d6106207136b.webm?t=1755148438\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463910/extras/c913f5d0abfd9b56ebc4d6106207136b.mp4?t=1755148438\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25b6</strong>\u00a0<strong><i>&quot;If you can't beat them physically, you'll just have to outsmart them!&quot;\u00a0</i></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of each battle, choose between new items or Cubes to add to your inventory.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With over 70 different Cubes and 60 items, the way you play each run will be entirely different.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your deck around whatever archetype you enjoy playing the most.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock-able content through Steam Achievements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Random events and enemy variety will make sure that even with the same deck, the key to victory will never be so straight-forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2800 <br>\u2800</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2800</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463910/extras/45a814aac047ce7a48924ebb74f9ea83.avif?t=1755148438\" width=450 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25b6</strong>\u00a0\u00a0<strong><i>&quot;Don't look at me...! This coward, hiding behind a closed door doesn't deserve you!&quot;</i></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as the Liu family as they find themselves tangled up in a series of misfortunate events, all starting with a reckless decision to rob a Station...</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the\u00a0authoritarian country of Heijing through the eyes of the citizens with the most potential.\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch the tragicomedy unfold throughout multiple Side Stories.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463910/extras/c3994ee687c18e66131feacdf726c893.poster.avif?t=1755148438\" width=700 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463910/extras/c3994ee687c18e66131feacdf726c893.webm?t=1755148438\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463910/extras/c3994ee687c18e66131feacdf726c893.mp4?t=1755148438\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25b6\u00a0<i>&quot;But I'm still not the strongest...!&quot;</i></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>\u00a0</strong></i>Snow \u2022 Fall is a  deck builder rogue-like that mixes unique and strategic gameplay with fast-paced fights and satisfying item synergies.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play a Cube and have Droplets face off. The person who rolls the higher number gets to attack.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch as your character performs high-damage combos against the enemy at your command. Or have the opposite happen, if you're bad.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each battle is a test of your game knowledge and\u00a0ability to\u00a0adapt to unknown circumstances.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more you play, the more you'll understand. Make game destroying combinations or be sent back to the main menu, it all depends on you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2800 <br>\u2800</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2800</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463910/extras/c913f5d0abfd9b56ebc4d6106207136b.poster.avif?t=1755148438\" width=800 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463910/extras/c913f5d0abfd9b56ebc4d6106207136b.webm?t=1755148438\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463910/extras/c913f5d0abfd9b56ebc4d6106207136b.mp4?t=1755148438\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25b6</strong>\u00a0<strong><i>&quot;If you can't beat them physically, you'll just have to outsmart them!&quot;\u00a0</i></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of each battle, choose between new items or Cubes to add to your inventory.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With over 70 different Cubes and 60 items, the way you play each run will be entirely different.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your deck around whatever archetype you enjoy playing the most.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock-able content through Steam Achievements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Random events and enemy variety will make sure that even with the same deck, the key to victory will never be so straight-forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2800 <br>\u2800</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2800</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463910/extras/45a814aac047ce7a48924ebb74f9ea83.avif?t=1755148438\" width=450 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25b6</strong>\u00a0\u00a0<strong><i>&quot;Don't look at me...! This coward, hiding behind a closed door doesn't deserve you!&quot;</i></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as the Liu family as they find themselves tangled up in a series of misfortunate events, all starting with a reckless decision to rob a Station...</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the\u00a0authoritarian country of Heijing through the eyes of the citizens with the most potential.\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch the tragicomedy unfold throughout multiple Side Stories.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
